---
import { site, sitePath } from '../data/site';
const { related = [] } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="aside-card author-card">
  <div class="author-avatar">阿</div>
  <span class="aside-label">ABOUT THE AUTHOR</span>
  <h2>{site.author}</h2>
  <p>嵌入式软件工程师的学习与项目记录。记录方案、调试过程，也留下一些复盘。</p>
  <a class="text-link" href={sitePath('about/')}>了解更多 <span>↗</span></a>
</section>
<section class="aside-card notice-card">
  <span class="aside-label">站点说明</span>
  <p>内容来自原有学习笔记与项目资料，持续补充。文章日期未记录时不补造时间。</p>
</section>
{related.length > 0 && <section class="aside-card related-card">
  <span class="aside-label">继续阅读</span>
  {related.map(post => <a href={post.url}>{post.title}<small>{post.category}</small></a>)}
</section>}
